    "detailed_description": "Red Eye is an adrenaline-pumping runner game that combines the excitement of endless running with the thrill of demon hunting. Step into the shoes of a fearless warrior on a mission to rid the world of evil. With your trusty firearm in hand, prepare to shoot down hordes of menacing demons that emerge from the depths of hell.<br />\r\nKey features:<br />\r\n-The game's atmospheric soundtrack adds to the tension, keeping you on the edge of your seat as you fight for your life.<br />\r\n-Intuitive controls &amp; immersive gameplay<br />\r\n-Different weapons<br />\r\nAre you ready to face the forces of hell and emerge victorious?",
